return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Goobaha lagu martigeliyo Zinn Digital®. Waxay maamushaa kaydka meel-ku-gaarka ah (cache) ee uu server-kaaga Zinn® horay u bixiyo — nadiifin toos ah oo caqli leh marka ay nuxurku isbedesho, nadiifin fog oo ka timid dashboard-kaaga Zinn®, badhanka shidista iyo daminta ee Redis object-cache, ka reebitaan ammaan ah WordPress/WooCommerce, iyo hal-guji-gal ah oo maamule ah. Kani waa kontoroolka kaydka, ee ma aha mashiinka kaydka. Meel kale ma ku martigelineysaa? Ku rakib Zinn® Cache Engine beddelkeeda.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kaydka','Page cache'=>'Bogga kaydka meelgaarka ah','Object cache'=>'Kaydka shayga','Purging'=>'Tiroobista','Exclusions'=>'Ka reeban','Purge everything now'=>'Nadiifi wax kasta hadda','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Bog kasta oo keydsan (cached) waa la tirtiray waxaana dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaashu yimaadaan. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Full-page cache'=>'Kaydka bogga buuxa','Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Waxaa u adeega LiteSpeed ​​ee adeegaha shabakadda, ka hor intaysan WordPress shaqayn. Halkaan waxaa ka yimaada inta badan xawaaraha.','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages'=>'U dir madax-kontormooleha LiteSpeed ​​iyo madax-qoraalka calaamadda boggaga la keydin karo','How long a page stays cached'=>'Inta uu boggu kaydsan yahay','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Ilbidhiqsi. Todobaad ayaa ku habboon inta badan mareegaha; bogga wararka ee daabaca saacad kasta wuxuu rabaa wax aad uga yar.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Inta ay le\'eg tahay inta uu biraawsarka booqashadu hayo sawirrada iyo qoraallada kombuyuutarka','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo. Waxay khusaysaa kaliya sawirrada, CSS-ka iyo JavaScript-ka — weligeed ma khusayso bogagga. U deji 0 si aad tan ugu dayfto martigeliyahaaga.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Booqdayeyaasha soo galay','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Weligea ha u adeegin bogag kaydsan booqde soo galay','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Daaridu waa jawaabta badbaadada leh waana tan caadiga ah. Demi kaliya haddii aad ogtahay in bog kasta oo la kaydiyay uu u siman yahay isticmaale kasta oo soo galay — bogga xubinnimada ayaa ah sababta caadiga ah ee aan loo damin.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Nolosho kala duwan ee xogta kala duwan','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Tusaale ahaan: bogagga badeecada ee dukaanka muddo saacad ah, iyadoo wax kasta oo kale ay sii jiraan hal toddobaad.','Add a rule'=>'Ku dar sharci','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','Seconds'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Kaydka walxaha (Redis)','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Wuxuu kaydiyaa natiijooyinka su\'aalaha database-ka. Waxay siweyn uga caawisaa dukaanka mashquulka badan ama bogga leh taraafiko badan oo soo galay, halkaas oo kaydka boggu (page cache) awoodin inuu sameeyo.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Ku rakib Redis object-cache drop-in','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay kordhinta phpredis. Haddii ay ka maqan tahay, sanduuqa ka sarreeya shaashaddan ayaa sidaas sheegaya.','Redis host'=>'Martida Redis','Redis port'=>'Boortiga Redis','Redis database'=>'Xogtaanka Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Go site kasta oo ku yaalla Redis wadareed lambarkiisa gaarka ah, ama midba midka kale ka tirtiri doono kaydkiisa (cache).','Redis password'=>'Erayga sirta ah ee Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Haddii Redis uusan u baahnayn, meesha ka bannee.','Key prefix'=>'Furaha hordhaca','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Beddelka lambarka database-ka ee gooni ah marka aadan yeelan karin.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Nadiifin caqli badan oo toos ah','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Si toos ah u nadiifi bogagga ay dhibaatadu saameysey marka nuxurku isbeddelo','After updates'=>'Ka dib cusboonaysiinta','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Tirtir wax kasta oo ka dambeeya cusboonaysiinta asaasiga ah, qalabka ama mawduuca','After a comment'=>'Ka dib faallo','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Nadiifi bogga qoraalka marka faallo ku taal la oggolaado','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Dami tan qayb faallooyin ah oo aad u mashquul badan, halkaas oo ay ku nadiifin karto boggaas oo kale boqolaal jeer saacaddii.','Never cache these'=>'Weligi ha kaydin kuwani','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Heerarka caadiga ah ee macquulka ah ee WordPress iyo WooCommerce ayaa had iyo jeer la adeegsadaa — gaariga iibsashada, bixinta lacagta, akoonkayga iyo kalfadhi kasta oo la galay weligood lama kaydiyo, wax kasta oo hooseeya.','Addresses'=>'Ciwaannada IP-ga','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hal dariiq ah sadarkiiiba, tusaale ahaan <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> dhammaadka ku taal waxay waafaqaysaa wax kasta oo hoos yaalla.','Query parameters'=>'Cabashooyinka weydiinta','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Bog ay ku jirto mid ka mid ah kuwan lagama kaydiyo — tusaale ahaan calaamada horu-eegista ee hal mar la isticmaalo.','Cookies'=>'Buskud','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Booqde sidan wata waxaa mar walba loo adeegaa bog cusub.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Bog kasta oo kaydsan waa la tirtiray. Waxaa dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaal yimaadaan.','The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed.'=>'Kaydka bogga waa mid daaran, laakin server-kani ma aha LiteSpeed.','The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'Madaxyo kaydinta waa la dirayaa mana jiro wax aqrinaya, markaas boggaggu dhab ahaantii lama kaydinayo. Weydii madaxaaga martigelinta haddii LiteSpeed ​​la heli karo, ama u guuri Zinn® martigelinta halkaas oo ay caadi tahay.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Kaydka shaygu waa daaran yahay, laakiin adeegetani ma taageerto Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kordhiyaha phpredis lama rakibin, markaa lama isticmaali karo qalabka loo yaqaan drop-in, WordPress-na waxay ku noqonaysaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydii shirkaddaada martigelinta inay awood u yeelato phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Wax khasnad ah lama keydinayo.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Labada kayd (cache) waa la damiyay, markaa furahaani (plugin) ma keenayo in boggu si dhakhso ah u shaqeeyo.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Kaydinta ayaa ka shaqeyneysa boggan.','Web server'=>'Web server','LiteSpeed — page caching available'=>'LiteSpeed — kaydinta bogaggu waa la heli karaa','not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable'=>'LiteSpeed ​​ma aha - kaydinta bogaggu waa aan la heli karin','Redis support'=>'Taageerada Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis waa la rakibay','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis lama rakibin','Page lifetime'=>'Muddada nolosha bogga','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Uma oggola inaad nadiifiso kaydka.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Nadiifinta kaydka ayaa la codsaday.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: shayga kaydinta shayga kale waa la rakibay, markaa Redis kaydinta shayga looma maamulo plugin-kan.','detected'=>'la ogaaday','not detected'=>'lama ogaan','phpredis extension missing'=>'eextenshanka phpredis ayaa maqan','active'=>'firfircoon','inactive'=>'aan firfircoonayn','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Kaydka LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Kaydka walxaha Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Eextenshanka Redis PHP (phpredis) kuma jiro server-kan, sidaas darteed kaydka walxaha lama shidi karo.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Drop-in-ka object-cache kale ayaa horay loo sii rakibay. Ka saar kahor intaadan awood-siin Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Faylka habaynta xiriirka Redis lama qori karin.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha ee la keydiyay lama akhrin karin.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha laguma rakibi karin wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama saari karin.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Nidaamka faylalka WordPress lama qori karo, sidaas darteed drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama maareyn karin.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Xiriirkan gelitaanka ee hal-guji ah mar dambe ma ansax aha. Xiriiriyayaashu waxay dhacayaan daqiiqado kadib waxaana la isticmaali karaa hal mar oo keliya — ka fur boggaaga dashboard-ka Zinn® mar labaad si aad u hesho mid cusub.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta dhammaystirnaanteeda, lamana rakibin.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyey. Geli qiime cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Sifee liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Wax a waafaqsan miirahaas ma jiraan.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Plug認証 kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku yaalla boggan, iyo inuu shaqeynayo iyo inkale.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Looma baahna xiriir kor u qaadahan (plugin) kan.','Open settings'=>'Fur dejinta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haystabis ogolaansho aad ku beddesho dejimahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha dejinta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Kaydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofinta habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu deji sida caadiga ah','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay ku celinaysaa dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan sidii ay asal ahaan ahaan jirtay. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Cilad-baarista taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo dejiso faylka dejinta','Import'=>'Keenso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood kuma jiraan erayada sirta ah, calaamadaha ama furayaasha API - waa inaad kuwan dib u gelisaa bogga cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dejinta kasta oo ku taal qalabkan (plugin) waxay ku noqotay sidii loogu talagalay asalka ahaan.','Done.'=>'La dhammeeyay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falalkaas lama heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrisan karo. Dooro faylka dejinta ee laga soo dhoofiyay Zinn® plugin.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Feylkaasi waa mid aad u weyn oo aan noqon karin dhoofinta dejinta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkani ma aha dhoofinta dejinta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Feylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay qalab kale (%s), markaa halkan lagu soo dhoofiyo waxay kaydinaysaa dejinta aanu qalabkani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d goobtii waa la soo dhoofiyay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar kale gali kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d goobaha la dhoofiyay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar labaad geli kuwaas.','Connected'=>'Xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ku xidhan, laakiin wax baa u baahan in laga shaqeeyo','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Running on your own account'=>'Ka shaqaynaya akoonkaaga','We could not check this'=>'Kama aan soo kaban karin tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Qalabkan dheerada ahi ma uusan sheegin sababta. Dir warbixinta ogaanshaha waxaanan eegeynaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay waxaa la hubiyay %s ka hor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa sida saxda ah ee loo diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, waxna ma qarsana. Furayaashaada sirta ah, calaamadaha aqoonsiga (tokens) iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ku koobi sabuuradda','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Warbixintan u dir taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu fureynaa tikidh taageero ah waxaana kuugu soo jawaabeynaa iimayl. Haddii aadan jeclayn inaad dirto, kor ka soo guuri oo adigu iska geli tikidh.','Copied'=>'La guuriyay','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Lama gaari karin Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s) laga bilaabo. Nuqul ka yeero warbixinta kor ku xusan oo fur tikidh beddelkeeda — wax khalad ah kama jiraan dejintaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxaana ay kuugu soo jawaabi doonaan iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay haysataa warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kuugu soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl ahaan.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay warbixino dhowr ah waqti gaaban gudahood. Sug daqiiqado yar kadibna mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma awoorin in ay aqbasho warbixinta hadda — taasi waa dhinankeenna, ee maaha kanaga. Dib u day mar dhow, ama koobiyee warbixinta kore oo geli tigidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Koobi garso kore oo fur tigidh, adigoo xiganaya lambarkaas.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosingka Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, keymoimidaha maalinlaha ah, haajiridda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga kontoroolka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa kala iibsiga ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qoraayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khuburada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalabkooda soo gudbiyaan.','Style preset'=>'Habka qaabka','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Bilaabashada. Wixii ka hooseeya ayaa ka sarreeya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabbiradayda','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Kani xirow oo hore-u-dejinta si sax ah ayaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida ay tahay.']];